# 为什么打开了这个文件？SSH Proxy 还没有可连接的 SSH 服务器。请在下面填写你的服务器，
# 保存后在托盘点 Start proxy（或运行 ssh_proxy_cli start）。
# Why did this file open? SSH Proxy has no SSH server to connect to yet. Add yours below,
# save, then click Start proxy in the tray (or run ssh_proxy_cli start).
#
# 填写方法：删掉下面示例每行开头的 "# "，换成你自己的信息。
# How: remove the "# " at the start of each example line and enter your own details.
#
# Host my-proxy
#     HostName ssh.example.com
#     User my-user
#     Port 22
#
# 有多台服务器时，照样再写一段 Host；第一台连不上时自动用下一台。
# For more servers, add another Host block; the next one is used if the first fails.
#
# ===== 中文：设置免密码登录 =====
# 代理在后台运行，必须能不输入密码自动登录。保存本文件后，在托盘点 Start proxy，
# 或在安装目录的终端运行（Windows 用 .\ssh_proxy_cli.exe）：
#       ./ssh_proxy_cli login
# 它会自动完成需要的步骤，已完成的会跳过：
#   1. 没有 SSH 密钥时自动创建（~/.ssh/id_ed25519）。
#   2. 首次连接显示服务器指纹：向管理员确认后输入 yes。
#   3. 提示时输入一次服务器密码，它会把你的公钥加到服务器上；以后不再需要密码。
#   4. 最后检查能否免密码登录，显示 Ready 即可使用。
# 若服务器不允许密码登录：把 login 显示的公钥（ssh-ed25519 开头的一行）发给管理员，
# 加好后再运行一次 login。
#
# ----- 可选：指定密钥（IdentityFile） -----
# 使用默认位置的密钥（如 ~/.ssh/id_ed25519）时不用填写。密钥在其他位置，或有多把
# 密钥想指定其中一把时，在对应 Host 下加：
#     IdentityFile ~/.ssh/my_key
#     IdentitiesOnly yes          （可选）只用这把密钥
# login 会使用这个文件；文件不存在时会在该位置创建。
#
# ----- 可选：不用 login，手动设置 -----
# 1. 生成密钥：ssh-keygen -t ed25519
# 2. 把公钥加到服务器（会提示输入一次服务器密码），或把 .pub 文件内容发给管理员：
#       macOS/Linux：ssh-copy-id -p 22 my-user@ssh.example.com
#       Windows PowerShell：
#         Get-Content "$env:USERPROFILE\.ssh\id_ed25519.pub" | ssh -p 22 my-user@ssh.example.com "mkdir -p ~/.ssh; cat >> ~/.ssh/authorized_keys"
# 3. 密钥设置了口令时，用 ssh-add 加载到 ssh-agent。Windows 需先在管理员 PowerShell 执行一次：
#       Set-Service ssh-agent -StartupType Automatic; Start-Service ssh-agent
# 4. 检查：./ssh_proxy_cli login --check    成功即可启动代理。
#
# ===== English: set up passwordless login =====
# The proxy runs in the background, so it must log in without a password. After saving this
# file, click Start proxy in the tray, or run this in a terminal in the install folder
# (on Windows use .\ssh_proxy_cli.exe):
#       ./ssh_proxy_cli login
# It does whatever is still needed and skips what's already done:
#   1. Creates an SSH key (~/.ssh/id_ed25519) if you don't have one.
#   2. On first connection it shows the server fingerprint: confirm it with your administrator, then type yes.
#   3. Enter your server password once when asked; your public key is added to the server,
#      so no password is needed after that.
#   4. Checks that login works without a password and shows Ready.
# If the server doesn't allow password login: send the public key login prints (the line starting
# with ssh-ed25519) to your administrator, then run login again.
#
# ----- Optional: choose a key (IdentityFile) -----
# Not needed for a key in the default location (such as ~/.ssh/id_ed25519). If your key is
# elsewhere, or you have several keys and want a specific one, add under that Host:
#     IdentityFile ~/.ssh/my_key
#     IdentitiesOnly yes          (optional) use only this key
# login uses that file, and creates it there if it doesn't exist.
#
# ----- Optional: set up manually instead of login -----
# 1. Create a key: ssh-keygen -t ed25519
# 2. Add the public key to the server (asks for your server password once), or send the .pub
#    file's contents to your administrator:
#       macOS/Linux: ssh-copy-id -p 22 my-user@ssh.example.com
#       Windows PowerShell:
#         Get-Content "$env:USERPROFILE\.ssh\id_ed25519.pub" | ssh -p 22 my-user@ssh.example.com "mkdir -p ~/.ssh; cat >> ~/.ssh/authorized_keys"
# 3. If the key has a passphrase, load it into ssh-agent with ssh-add. On Windows, first run once
#    in an administrator PowerShell:
#       Set-Service ssh-agent -StartupType Automatic; Start-Service ssh-agent
# 4. Check: ./ssh_proxy_cli login --check    once it succeeds, you can start the proxy.
#
# 本文件位于安装目录，首次启动时由 support/ssh_config.in 复制而来；请改这里，support/ 中的文件升级时会被替换。
# This file lives in the install folder, copied from support/ssh_config.in on first start. Edit it here;
# support/ is replaced on upgrade.
